{"mode":"words","text":"Herfra afhænger det af dit læringsmål. Hvis du blot vil forstå sproget, har du allerede nået dit mål – bliv bare ved trin to og tre. Hvis du vil tale, kommer kor-talningen ind: Vælg en kort sætning med A-B-gentagelsen, sæt hastigheden helt ned, og tal med stemmen samtidig – ligesom i et kor. Du hører straks, hvis noget lyder anderledes, og retter dig helt af dig selv. Det kan du gøre overalt, selv i sporvognen: Med hovedtelefoner lyder det som en telefonsamtale. Og hvis du vil lære at skrive, skal du blot skrive teksten med sætning for sætning.","words":[{"s":0,"e":557},{"s":685,"e":1161},{"s":1207,"e":1324},{"s":1370,"e":1486},{"s":1509,"e":1683},{"s":1753,"e":2566},{"s":2810,"e":2972},{"s":3019,"e":3100},{"s":3146,"e":3344},{"s":3390,"e":3483},{"s":3518,"e":3913},{"s":3959,"e":4423},{"s":4458,"e":4586},{"s":4609,"e":4679},{"s":4737,"e":5155},{"s":5213,"e":5433},{"s":5457,"e":5584},{"s":5642,"e":5875},{"s":6026,"e":6142},{"s":6467,"e":6629},{"s":6676,"e":6908},{"s":6931,"e":7070},{"s":7094,"e":7372},{"s":7454,"e":7616},{"s":7709,"e":7767},{"s":7790,"e":8255},{"s":9067,"e":9242},{"s":9288,"e":9346},{"s":9392,"e":9485},{"s":9520,"e":9950},{"s":9996,"e":10263},{"s":10310,"e":11145},{"s":11192,"e":11540},{"s":12237,"e":12469},{"s":12492,"e":12562},{"s":12643,"e":12933},{"s":13003,"e":13398},{"s":13479,"e":13595},{"s":13630,"e":14895},{"s":15279,"e":15476},{"s":15546,"e":16080},{"s":16161,"e":16393},{"s":16428,"e":16765},{"s":17148,"e":17264},{"s":17299,"e":17508},{"s":17577,"e":17670},{"s":17693,"e":18019},{"s":18077,"e":18657},{"s":18773,"e":18889},{"s":19005,"e":19365},{"s":19447,"e":19470},{"s":19563,"e":19690},{"s":19783,"e":20352},{"s":21652,"e":21815},{"s":21861,"e":22082},{"s":22128,"e":22628},{"s":22663,"e":22825},{"s":22906,"e":23115},{"s":23150,"e":23348},{"s":23394,"e":24021},{"s":24137,"e":24241},{"s":24276,"e":24613},{"s":24694,"e":24787},{"s":24810,"e":25054},{"s":25101,"e":25159},{"s":25194,"e":25275},{"s":25310,"e":25716},{"s":26